    "deviation_notes": "minor drift: the source player feels the swing-count rhythm building to a periodic detonation (every 3rd swing) -- the engine has no native every-Nth-swing accumulator, so it is filed as a two-tier-accumulator family accrual and approximated via trigger_grammar, not delivered natively. Curse of Frailty's RR token is withheld (shape unanchored). No status emitted. Stays terminal MAPPED (CLOSE with a family-accrual candidate) per R-M7.",
